<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>
    S.S.G - Strategy | Strength | Growth - SSG Server
  </title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>

<body>
  <div class="navbar">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px;">
        <!-- Main Stack (Image on top, Buttons on bottom) -->
        <div
          style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px; width: 100%; text-align: center;">

          <!-- Logo: Expands to full width with a cap for quality -->
          <img src="https://factionimages.torn.com/9b0aeb5d-75fe-4ff8-a528-0999948ffadf-53272.gif" alt="SSGLogo"
            style="width: 100%; max-width: 1000px; height: auto; display: block;">
          <h1 style="margin: 0;">
            S.S.G - Strategy | Strength | Growth
          </h1>

          <% if (user) { %>
            <!-- Centered Text and Buttons -->
            <div class="nav-links"
              style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 15px; margin-top: 10px;">
              <span style="font-size: 1rem; width: 100%; margin-bottom: 5px;">Hi, <strong>
                  <%= user.username %>
                </strong>!</span>
              <a href="/dashboard" class="btn" style="min-width: 120px;">Dashboard</a>
              <a href="/logout" class="btn btn-danger" style="min-width: 120px;">Logout</a>
            </div>
            <% } else { %>
              <div class="nav-links" style="margin-top: 10px;">
                <a href="/auth/discord" class="btn btn-primary">Discord Login</a>
              </div>
              <% } %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <!-- Faction Description Section -->
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="faction-description">
        <p>Welcome to S.S.G, where strategy, strength, and growth define everything we do.
          </br>
          We're more than just a faction we're a team built on trust, teamwork, and the drive to succeed together.
          </br>
          We strive to maintain a safe and fun environment to play, grow, and dominate the city together.
          </br>
          We also have a Day Care should you also need it. </p>
        <div class="desc-grid">
          <div class="desc-card">
            <h4>Strategy</h4>
            <p>Every move we make is calculated.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="desc-card">
            <h4>Strength</h4>
            <p>We train hard, fight smart, and back each other up in every war.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="desc-card">
            <h4>Growth</h4>
            <p>Whether you're a seasoned fighter or just starting out, </br>
              we'll help you level up fast with guidance, faction parks, group activities, competition, and team
              building exercises.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h2>Perks</h2>
        <div class="perks-grid">
          <div class="perks-card">
            <h4>Weapons</h4>
            <p>Provided by the faction</p>
          </div>
          <div class="perks-card">
            <h4>Armor</h4>
            <p>Provided by the faction</p>
          </div>
          <div class="perks-card">
            <h4>Medical</h4>
            <p>Ipecac, Medical kits, morphine, and blood bags provided by the faction to be used anytime</p>
          </div>
          <div class="perks-card">
            <h4>Consumables</h4>
            <p>Candy to be used anytime for jumps</p>
          </div>
          <div class="perks-card">
            <h4>Drugs</h4>
            <p>Xanax and Vicodin supplied by the faction during war</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="perks-grid">
          <div class="perks-card">
            <h4>Travel</h4>
            <p>Carry an additional 7 items</p>
          </div>
          <div class="perks-card">
            <h4>Travel Cost</h4>
            <p>Reduced by 15%</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>What we expect from you:</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Daily activity in discord and in game</li>
            <li>Join OC (90% payout)</li>
            <li>Join In with war and chaining</li>
            <li>Join our S.S.G Discord and Torn Stats</li>
            <li>Chat as much as you can and be a team player</li>
            <li>Most Importantly, have fun!</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Faction Stats -->
  <div class="faction-stats">
    <div class="stat-card">
      <h4>
        29
      </h4>
      <p>Total Members</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card">
      <h4>
        5
      </h4>
      <p>Teams</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Groups Section -->
  <section class="groups-section">
    <h2>Our Groups</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Each division plays a vital role in our faction's success</p>
    <div class="groups-grid">
      <!--Ownership Card-->
      <div class="owner-card">
        <div class="group-header">
          <h3>
            Ownership
          </h3>
          <span class="group-members">
            3 Members</span>
        </div>
        <p class="group-description">
          These 3 members own the faction and have final decision on all aspect of the faction. All three members are available to assist, train, and answer questions.
        </p>
        <div class="group-footer">
            <p><strong>focus:</strong>
              Our goal is to ensure you understand what you are doing no matter the team you are on.
            </p>
          </div>
      </div>
      <!--Leadership Card-->
      <div class="lead-card">
        <div class="group-header">
          <h3>
            Leadership
          </h3>
          <span class="group-members">
            2 Members</span>
        </div>
        <p class="group-description">
          These members help to determine the path that the faction is on. Leadership is available to help answer questions as they arise.
        </p>
        <div class="group-footer">
            <p><strong>focus:</strong>
              Assisting ownership in day-to-day operations and to ensure members of each team have what they need to succeed.
            </p>
          </div>
      </div>
      <!--Strategy Card-->
      <div class="strat-card">
        <div class="group-header">
          <h3>
            Strategy
          </h3>
          <span class="group-members">
            4 Members</span>
        </div>
        <p class="group-description">
              This team is made up of members who are greater than level 15 and have shown the ability to help leadership plan and execute war plans. This team is a leadership invite only.
        </p>
        <div class="group-footer">
            <p><strong>focus:</strong>
              To ensure members of Strength and Growth understand the war strategy, war rules, and are prepared to war.
            </p>
          </div>
      </div>
      <!--Strength Card-->
      <div class="stren-card">
        <div class="group-header">
          <h3>
            Strength
          </h3>
          <span class="group-members">
            17 Members</span>
        </div>
        <p class="group-description">
          This team is made up of members at level 15 or greater. Their focus is on stats (and playing the rest of the game).
        </p>
        <div class="group-footer">
            <p><strong>focus:</strong>
                  Making money to purchase items for stats growth and to be able to rent a Private Island with an airstrip.
            </p>
          </div>
      </div>
      <!--Growth Card-->
      <div class="grow-card">
        <div class="group-header">
          <h3>
            Growth
          </h3>
          <span class="group-members">
            3 Members</span>
        </div>
        <p class="group-description">
          This team is made up of members under level 15.
        </p>
        <div class="group-footer">
            <p><strong>focus:</strong>
              Making their way to level 15 through attacks (leaving their opponent), crimes, and training in the gym.
            </p>
          </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container">
      <p>&copy; 2026 S.S.G - Strategy | Strength | Growth. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>

</html>